        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### AIOps \u2014 UPS & PAC Anomaly Monitoring (Production)\n- **Scope:** Real-time production monitoring for `ME_UPS1`\u2013`ME_UPS3` and `ME_PAC1`\u2013`ME_PAC4`.\n- **Datasource:** Zabbix Production Plugin (`dfzvifoy1efpcb`).\n- **Operational Disclaimer:** Statistical anomalies flagged by unsupervised baseline models represent deviations from baseline distributions and **do NOT** automatically imply physical equipment failure or Remaining Useful Life (RUL) expiration.\n- **Production Safety:** 0 production changes, 0 service restarts, 0 Zabbix write operations."
